+# Pet species crop classifier
+
+Quantized MobileNet V2, 1.0 width, 224-pixel RGB input. Obtained from tensorflow/tflite-support at revision 5b56ec4d1479d3330d4f18f9a647d4c21d375d00, under tensorflow_lite_support/metadata/python/tests/testdata/image_classifier/mobilenet_v2_1.0_224_quant.tflite. The accompanying labels.txt defines the 1,001 output indices, including background at 0. The model and license are distributed unchanged. SHA-256 f08d447cde49b4e0446428aa921aff0a14ea589fa9c5817b31f83128e9a43c1d.
+
+The classifier reads an existing pet track cropped with a 6% margin on each side. Its result may update the viewfinder species label. A top domestic dog or cat class needs a lead of at least 2.0 logits over the other group in two fresh observations. The quantized output step is 0.09889254.
